{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fc1bf623-7c8e-8dda-a15c-c94c873ab036",
  "created_at": "2026-01-20T11:13:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Carlos L. Moniz",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:10:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Newport Recreation, this is Beth. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Beth. Sorry, I'm gonna keep my voice down, [pause] somebody's sleeping in the next room."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, no problem at all. Take your time, I can hear you fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:22-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great, thanks. So, um, I wanted to ask about the beach parks. What time do they close in the winter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure thing. Which one were you thinking of? Easton's, Gooseberry, King Park?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "King Park, down by the water. The one with the little beach and the walking path."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:11:48-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, King Park. In the winter months the city parks close at sunset. So it's earlier than summer, right around dusk, and they open back up at sunrise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:02-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunset. Okay. Hang on, let me grab a pen. [pause] Okay. Could you say that one more time? I want to write it down so I don't forget."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:16-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course! Open at sunrise, closed at sunset, all winter long. So this time of year that's late afternoon, around four-thirty or so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sunrise to sunset. Got it. Four-thirty, give or take. Perfect."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it. Are you planning a visit?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:39-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, my sister's driving down from Tiverton to help out this week, and she loves that spot. We'll probably walk over once she gets here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:12:52-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that sounds lovely. It's a pretty walk, even when it's cold. Just bundle up, it gets windy off the bay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:03-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, I'll tell her. Wicked windy, I know. [pause] Sorry, hold on, I think I heard something. Okay, no, we're good."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:14-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries. Anything else I can help with today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:19-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Nope, that's everything. Sunrise to sunset, that's all I needed. Thanks a lot, Beth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:27-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "My pleasure. Enjoy the walk, and tell your sister hello from Rec!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Take care."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-20T11:13:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, bye now."
    }
  ],
